   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Chapter 7. We change ONLY the jar lid.\nRegular model (SDXL base) + Set Latent Noise Mask + denoise 1.0 (the mask protects the rest).\nImage Composite Masked pastes the new part into the original, so everything else stays pixel-identical.\nFiles: jar.png and jar_lid_mask.png (white = change). To draw your own mask: right-click Load Image ->\nOpen in MaskEditor, then connect the MASK output of Load Image instead.\n\nLICENCES (as of 26 Oct 2026 - check before selling):\n- SDXL base 1.0: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M - commercial use allowed, with a list of prohibited uses.\nNot legal advice."
   ],
